## Quick Install

```bash
curl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/AaronTan11/rhemify/main/scripts/install.sh | bash
```

Works on Linux, macOS, and WSL2. The installer handles everything — Python, Node.js, dependencies, and the `rhemify` command. No prerequisites except git.

> **Windows:** Native Windows is not supported. Please install [WSL2](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/wsl/install) and run the command above.

After installation:

```bash
source ~/.bashrc    # reload shell (or: source ~/.zshrc)
rhemify              # start chatting!
```

---

## Getting Started

```bash
rhemify              # Interactive CLI — start a conversation
rhemify model        # Choose your LLM provider and model
rhemify tools        # Configure which tools are enabled
rhemify config set   # Set individual config values
rhemify gateway      # Start the messaging gateway (Telegram, Discord, etc.)
rhemify setup        # Run the full setup wizard (configures everything at once)
rhemify claw migrate # Migrate from upstream (if coming from upstream)
rhemify update       # Update to the latest version
rhemify doctor       # Diagnose any issues
```

📖 **[Full documentation →](https://rhemify.aarontan11.com/docs/)**

## CLI vs Messaging Quick Reference

Rhemify has two entry points: start the terminal UI with `rhemify`, or run the gateway and talk to it from Telegram, Discord, Slack, WhatsApp, Signal, or Email. Once you're in a conversation, many slash commands are shared across both interfaces.

| Action | CLI | Messaging platforms |
|---------|-----|---------------------|
| Start chatting | `rhemify` | Run `rhemify gateway setup` + `rhemify gateway start`, then send the bot a message |
| Start fresh conversation | `/new` or `/reset` | `/new` or `/reset` |
| Change model | `/model [provider:model]` | `/model [provider:model]` |
| Set a personality | `/personality [name]` | `/personality [name]` |
| Retry or undo the last turn | `/retry`, `/undo` | `/retry`, `/undo` |
| Compress context / check usage | `/compress`, `/usage`, `/insights [--days N]` | `/compress`, `/usage`, `/insights [days]` |
| Browse skills | `/skills` or `/<skill-name>` | `/skills` or `/<skill-name>` |
| Interrupt current work | `Ctrl+C` or send a new message | `/stop` or send a new message |
| Platform-specific status | `/platforms` | `/status`, `/sethome` |

For the full command lists, see the [CLI guide](https://rhemify.aarontan11.com/docs/user-guide/cli) and the [Messaging Gateway guide](https://rhemify.aarontan11.com/docs/user-guide/messaging).

