## Contributing

We welcome contributions! See the [Contributing Guide](https://rhemify.aarontan11.com/docs/developer-guide/contributing) for development setup, code style, and PR process.

Quick start for contributors:

```bash
git clone https://github.com/AaronTan11/rhemify.git
cd rhemify
curl -LsSf https://astral.sh/uv/install.sh | sh
uv venv venv --python 3.11
source venv/bin/activate
uv pip install -e ".[all,dev]"
python -m pytest tests/ -q
```

> **RL Training (optional):** To work on the RL/Tinker-Atropos integration:
> ```bash
> git submodule update --init tinker-atropos
> uv pip install -e "./tinker-atropos"
> ```

